<title>USA: Astra Merck names president.</title>
<headline>Astra Merck names president.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, Pa. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Astra Merck Inc, a joint venture between Astra AB and Merck &amp; Co Inc, said it has named Matthew Emmens as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Emmens has previously held the position of acting CEO since January 17, following Wayne Yetter's departure.</p>
<p>While overseeing the company's operations as acting CEO, Emmens has been implementing a major reorganization of Astra Merck, that has been in the planning stage since mid-1996, the company said.</p>
</text>
